igure out the overall size. Thank the gods, I found this app! It lets me create the foot print of my...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">This is an amazing app. Easy to use. I am working on building a barn for my wood working shop, struggling on what size to make it. I was going to go to graph paper to layout the interior, to try and figure out the overall size. Thank the gods, I found this app! It lets me create the foot print of my tools - save them as templates and then lay them out on different floor sizes. I purchased the premium, which is a steal for what this app does, and I can bring this app across all my devices. Amazing! I highly recommend this app!!!!!!!!</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">June 4, 2020</span></div>Thank you for the review and support!</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOFUPWpGfRcCB_eWan_dtT7sfaqOFJT0vkrXMoQlBwJOHlgJPYMHP8y_BpzyHoUqrwJaILXu35PLB0IJOA;$219 YjFXEf;_;$97"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-jfTPFZPqBSU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuuckqNl3L1P1idmxocVEVRWBc_PCsIw/w48-h48-n/photo.jpg" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-jfTPFZPqBSU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuuckqNl3L1P1idmxocVEVRWBc_PCsIw/w96-h96-n/photo.jpg 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-atf="false" data-iml="66291"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Kg Russe4654</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 4 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="L0jl5e