 maybe some kind of foundation like if the ...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">Love it spend longer than I probably should on it deciding where our furniture and things can go. Kitchen section needs a countertop option for ease of use and maybe a built in floor to ceiling cupboard that maybe extends just a little beyond the room. Yeah maybe some kind of foundation like if the house is built on a slope and defo a garden type area.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">May 14, 2020</span></div>I will try to improve symbol library in the future. Thank you for the suggestion. For now you could try to model the cupboard from existing cabinets. Please tap existing cabinet to select it and then use "tune" button (the last at the top of the screen, on the right hand side of the screen) to adjust height and vertical position of the cabinet.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOHdmdbPPJjQfqn_0Ex0ngRdCTM0vFsYM0QzApHJdqSd1l2DVBaIjn8Ow7kVMqWFauMoloQfuVsn6jIV9g;$295 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhOyvb5zEOeES3TPBXfqBevf-GjAKlyKEE-ZllFy0M=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhOyvb5zEOeES3TPBXfqBevf-GjAKlyKEE-ZllFy0M=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="84020"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Jasmeet Singh</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 5 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c">