to...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">Great little app and easy to use. I paid for the full version, but didn't really get anything extra other than to be able to save to various formats. Cant design loft space as can't draw roof at angle. I found I can change object height and top height, so created tv stand from drawer unit and worktop from box. Can't add these objects to general and kitchen. Still, I got more done with this than with other paid apps. Needs more work, but I highly recommend.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">February 2, 2020</span></div>You can add your preconfigured symbols to "User" category of the symbol toolbar. I will try to improve symbol library. Thank you for the suggestions.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOFSr87Lx__MAzgHIJ8frnM_padlnSCV6WuoVBPxC-G5zk-fqOsrQfdaa2zlKAGMLh656Hdw9mENHBBBJA;$765 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14Ghewle0sVxdn4lAqVgL0C7kiApJIxtCly37pHG2-g=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14Ghewle0sVxdn4lAqVgL0C7kiApJIxtCly37pHG2-g=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="150414"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Cristii Carrizales</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 5 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div></div></div></span><span class="p2TkOb">February 15, 2020</span></div></div><div class="YCMBp GVFJbb"><div jsaction="J