h3c">Link to this review</div></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">Awesome app for design your house.. it's free and easy to use. It's need only some updates like - wall hight, wallpaper design, some new furniture design, new features for balcony etc. Overall it's super app. I like it and suggest to all. Thanks 2 Feb 2020 Level hight option will change hight of all...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">Awesome app for design your house.. it's free and easy to use. It's need only some updates like - wall hight, wallpaper design, some new furniture design, new features for balcony etc. Overall it's super app. I like it and suggest to all. Thanks 2 Feb 2020 Level hight option will change hight of all walls, if i want change one or two walls hight, no option for this... Please guide or make changes. Thanks</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">February 2, 2020</span></div>Currently it is not possible to change height of individual room walls. You can change height of single interior walls created with "Walls" button: drag the button on a plan to create a wall and then click "Edit" to set its height.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOEWgBsv_589tCb9jcgoh3VXKxgukUMueAtIg6FObY4sw0nkHz2eaN3B9IA1h_5wSdPTy-bBXosDErGEAg;$774 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14Gj621FRpwmmMpaSE3G1AtnCIiA8KZpD7QXiJLdmaw=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14Gj621FRpwmmMpaSE3G1AtnCIiA8KZpD7QXiJLdmaw=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="150592"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div cla