is review" role="menuitem" tabindex="-1"><div class="aBBjbd MbhUzd" jsname="ksKsZd"></div><div class="uyYuVb oJeWuf" jscontroller="cCHjWd" jsaction="JIbuQc:kuHRr" jsname="kuHRr" jslog="77039; 1:6066; track:click;"><div class="jO7h3c">Link to this review</div></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">I really wish I could give it more stars but this ain't free... The app works fine but don't even try switching from your computer to your phone or vice versa, it'll tell you there's amd error and make you change your password every time. Plus, if you want to view the changes you made on your phone ...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">I really wish I could give it more stars but this ain't free... The app works fine but don't even try switching from your computer to your phone or vice versa, it'll tell you there's amd error and make you change your password every time. Plus, if you want to view the changes you made on your phone from your computer, you have to buy the full version. On your phone, you can't take a screenshot of your project which sucks if you want to keep your S.O. updated...</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">March 11, 2020</span></div>What exactly is the problem with cloud synchronization? It will ask you to change the password if you mistyped it in the settings. If you still have any problems with that then please contact me at support@floorplancreator.net and I will try to help. It took me a lot of time and effort to create this app, so I cannot give it away for free.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOFCufWfh9181pfcJpvW6WHroLTRsh_0kQHwN_J9oCUAsEgf5PNQonaEfMsb3rZumBHBdAWHQRnFjx2EGQ;