</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">It might be a stretch to use for build quality plans, but it's simple to use and does a great job of quickly allowing you to see what a new floor plan would look like. Liked it enough to buy the full version which allows exports of the files. Suggestions.. add the ability for roof design (adding an ...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">It might be a stretch to use for build quality plans, but it's simple to use and does a great job of quickly allowing you to see what a new floor plan would look like. Liked it enough to buy the full version which allows exports of the files. Suggestions.. add the ability for roof design (adding an addition often means figuring out how to tie in a new roof); make it easier to offset the floor level of an individual room by a few inches (this may already be possible but I couldn't figure it out). All-in-all a great app... nice job.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">November 23, 2018</span></div>Thank you. I am already working on roof editor. Raised floor is not supported yet, but I will try to add that in the future.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOHi70S2SfpnCxUPKCg-4s14UptO_Ikgp2xBLJVxach-4jtW7tsIRL45LV8gAsHbW89fpAbaXO5P0AvyJg;$879 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-XPza5sWVCQU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuucnffno_Sq7W9-EH82gr1rcdBD65Qw/w48-h48-n/photo.jpg" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-XPza5sWVCQU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuucnffno_Sq7W9-EH82gr1rcdBD65Qw/w96-h96-n/photo.jpg 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="160674"></d