iv></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">Great app but a few updates over the last few months have made it less user friendly. There was an update a few months ago that means when you drag in a new structure it can dent an existing structure rather than stopping next to it. I do not like this as a default setting and not sure if you can st...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">Great app but a few updates over the last few months have made it less user friendly. There was an update a few months ago that means when you drag in a new structure it can dent an existing structure rather than stopping next to it. I do not like this as a default setting and not sure if you can stop it. The undo button has been hidden away recently. If you select some text there is a "set as title" button which just annoys me when I accidentally press it. It needs to be hidden! When you rotate a structure the text box now rotates with it. Why? It just means I need to spin two things rather than one.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">October 4, 2018</span></div>Uncheck "Adjust room shape after drag". Undo is still there but you might need to scroll the toolbar if do not see it. To prevent label from rotating together with a room, tap it and click lock rotation icon. Set as title is probably not that useful, so I might move it to the end of the toolbar. You can always undo in case of accidental click.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOGN56I8xRny2P9ktpxDW_4_WbjJHJerIkQDeXzzLykP8pl4_3hK1QcVyZF2UlFS4vBSXAQXZQ13RTomLw;$888 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GjkRL3x