<div class="jO7h3c">Unhelpful</div></div></span><span jsslot="" class="z80M1 NmX0eb" jsaction="click:o6ZaF(preventDefault=true); mousedown:lAhnzb; mouseup:Osgxgf; mouseenter:SKyDAe; mouseleave:xq3APb;touchstart:jJiBRc; touchmove:kZeBdd; touchend:VfAz8(preventMouseEvents=true)" jsname="j7LFlb" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Spam" role="menuitemradio" tabindex="-1"><div class="aBBjbd MbhUzd" jsname="ksKsZd"></div><div class="uyYuVb oJeWuf" jscontroller="cCHjWd" jsaction="JIbuQc:Hw9KTb" jsname="Hw9KTb" jslog="77040; 1:1214; track:click;"><div class="O7wNO"></div><div class="jO7h3c">Spam</div></div></span><span jsslot="" class="z80M1" jsaction="click:o6ZaF(preventDefault=true); mousedown:lAhnzb; mouseup:Osgxgf; mouseenter:SKyDAe; mouseleave:xq3APb;touchstart:jJiBRc; touchmove:kZeBdd; touchend:VfAz8(preventMouseEvents=true)" jsname="j7LFlb" aria-label="Link to this review" role="menuitem" tabindex="-1"><div class="aBBjbd MbhUzd" jsname="ksKsZd"></div><div class="uyYuVb oJeWuf" jscontroller="cCHjWd" jsaction="JIbuQc:kuHRr" jsname="kuHRr" jslog="77039; 1:6066; track:click;"><div class="jO7h3c">Link to this review</div></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">I think this app is fantastic. There are some features that I think would benefit this app, other than that, the design is easy enough and the 3D view just blew my away. I am able to design my dream home and then have a virtual tour absolutely wonderfull. Congratulations and well done!! My desired a...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">I think this app is fantastic. There are some features that I think would benefit this app, other than that, the design is easy enough and the 3D view just blew my away. I am able to design my dream home and then have a virtual tour absolutely wonderfull. Congratulations and well done!! My desired additions would, as some of the others have mentioned, be as follow: 1. Roof construction ability. 2. Tiles and carpets 3. Outer wall colour ability 4. Folding doors for large open spaces i.e lapas, porches. 5. Some more variety of chairs, couches and tables. Current type of table and chair vary plain. 6. Ability to create circles and triangles in vertical position and lines in diagonal position for 3D viewing. 7. More variety of accessories. Rails, fencing, brick walls, gates, curtains, portraits, wall art/textures etc. 8. Maybe you can add a feature where you can use arrows to move around, because sometimes the view jumps around when using zoom function to move. Please note that I am not an app designer and don,t know enough about it to know how much effort goes into designing these kinds of features. Just making suggestions to make this app amazing. You get my 5 star rating for this.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">November 28, 2018</span></div>Thank you for the suggestions. I am already working on roof tool. Railing is available under General tab of the symbol toolbar - select it and click "Edit" to adjust its style. It is going to take quite a lot of time to implement these changes, but I will do my best.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOHZZrlb-F_Fzp7BWPD1nwG6ov79L0LYqwtAxIb7B61lx1TZ6zy_TgubqSREmuiNE8iT7wUOkcNMxSDd6w;$914 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GjwZdubyxYr0Ksnpnvq5qFzNTH0y-E62lZvUbuZ5g=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GjwZdubyxYr0Ksnpnvq5qFzNTH0y-E62lZvUbuZ5g=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="165929"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Hana