"cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">I am a professional, I have messed around with a lot of phone-CAD and this is the best for quick layouts.  Best of all I can sketch a floor plan with my pen, look at how not square or to scale it is and then correct the wall angles and lengths afterwards, incredibly useful! If you are whining about having to pay to use an app, well grow up, you have to pay for everything, food, gas, why not apps? (No I don't know the developer, yes I paid $9 for a whole app, now my children will go hungry) There are a few things I would like to see (but these are wishy listy things) Being able to place slabs more easily with exact relative heights so I can do decks, elevated or not, would also be neat if you could do a slab and then define the material as wood. Beams and joists, general sections for I beams, channels or columns.  stairs can they autocalculate?  If I have a 3' difference between 2 levels can i specify how many treads/risers or have it calc and tell me ok gonna stop,  could get silly with demands.  Anyway, good app, spend the $9 support the guy so he will do more</span></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOGkTUI-Vdjw1QX5ubrJqCJ3WGxdfd4SNgO9P1FImW_F5HKuOXS2naUKhCC-LolZDSTDT0XFVWa1ugtiyA;$986 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GinfuOmqDE-bEYlGUjmiPaCXVvzeKFjKNb1_Qsd=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GinfuOmqDE-bEYlGUjmiPaCXVvzeKFjKNb1_Qsd=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="173354"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Marse Walker</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 4 stars out of five stars" role=