ely easy to use and I found it a quick way to produce a floor plan of my business location. It would be nice it was a little more versatile in the area of furniture and such to add to your floor plan, but really for $7 it was $7 well spent. I would recommend this if you need to make basic floor plans for a home or business. And the ability to be able to print plans is awesome. The only recommendation I have is that there would be a bit more comprehensive tutorial. It took me a long time and a lot of erasers and drawing before I could figure out how to break an existing wall</span></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOEyZGW2Py3fV1p4-SxG-shdW8Keg370wOBDsEIzpS3sYnxZmXPPb6B4cPPhhVdPbi-JhAl_-VOP9o6n3Q;$989 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GjlSpzYD3qFeaGCepaG7zcunjdOZwYDGtLNYoQYvw=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GjlSpzYD3qFeaGCepaG7zcunjdOZwYDGtLNYoQYvw=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="173151"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Robert Amsbury</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 5 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div></div></div></span><span class="p2TkOb">July 1, 2019</span></div></div><div class="YCMBp GVFJbb"><div jsaction="JIbuQc:isb5Wc(isb5Wc);NrJVc:tUsItb;Juy6d:Hw9KTb;yIJnmd:kuHRr;s4H3C:HBdSge;" jsname="OuHhoc"><div class="XlMhZe"><div role="button" class="U26fgb mUbCce fKz7Od YYBxpf" jslog="77038; 1:1212; track:JIbuQc;" jscontroller="VXdfxd" jsaction="click:cOuCgd; mousedown:UX7yZ; mouseup:lbsD7e; mouseenter:tfO1Yc; mouseleave:JywGue; focus:AHmuwe; blur:O22p3e; contextmenu:mg9Pef;touchs