v jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">--Update 12DEC19-- Thank you for your reply to my original review, Marcin! Disregard my floor height issue, you fixed it with the update. I'm using the app more and more and I like it a lot! I like that it works with my Bosch laser measure. In addition to hiding items in the plan, it would be nice t...<div class="cQj82c"><button class="LkLjZd ScJHi OzU4dc  " jsaction="click:TiglPc" jsname="gxjVle">Full Review</button></div></span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;">--Update 12DEC19-- Thank you for your reply to my original review, Marcin! Disregard my floor height issue, you fixed it with the update. I'm using the app more and more and I like it a lot! I like that it works with my Bosch laser measure. In addition to hiding items in the plan, it would be nice to see a custom window option to create those oddly shaped windows. Ceiling heights for walls would be nice, especially in rooms with high walls on one end and lower walls on the other. Setting floor heights would also be nice, especially with a split-level home, my home has a basement, ground floor, 1st floor and 2nd floor, but they are not set to the average heights as traditional floors. They could all be there, but maybe I'm missing them somehow. --Original Review-- Great app, easy to use. I like that you can create custom objects. I would like to see the option to hide and unhide objects so that you test fit furniture that you are thinking of getting without removing existing objects.</span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">December 10, 2019</span></div>You can clone individual rooms, whole floors or entire projects to create multiple layout variants. I will try to add layers in the future that will let you hide some symbols while leaving others. Thank you for the suggestion.</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="