span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="LVJlx" class="UD7Dzf"> <span jsname="bN97Pc">Creating an very intricate plan and trying to export only to find you have to pay to export/screenshot anything. Waiting until the end to charge is a bad way to do it. Just annoys people. Maybe a trail period might be nice.</span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;"></span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">December 2, 2018</span></div>There is a dialog displayed right after you start the application for the first time that explains that exporting is not free. Unlimited PNG and JPEG export is just $4. You can export demo project to test each export format with its current settings (scale, orientation, image size, etc).</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOFWuHX-udEEkA4t_UXpJj_NgnkrUXL4wF2Vc0AtCMztyeggMDO-Zu9EwcGUNri-8q9NrQgHhXSHV46sPA;$1633 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g=w48-h48-n" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g=w96-h96-n 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="212552"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">A Google user</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 5 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div></div></div></span><span class="p2TkOb">October 6, 2018</span></div></div><div class="YCMBp GVFJbb"><div jsaction="JIbuQc:isb5Wc(isb5Wc);NrJVc:tUsItb;Juy6d:Hw9KTb;yIJ