d simply too much hassle. Paper was so much easier, I rue the day we had to use this software it really is inferior to a properly drawn plan from a trained surveyor.</span><span jsname="fbQN7e" style="display: none;"></span></div><div class="LVQB0b"><div class="QoPmEb"></div><div><span class="X43Kjb">Marcin Lewandowski</span><span class="p2TkOb">May 29, 2019</span></div>I am sorry that you had to use it, but it is not application's fault. I do not think the paper is better - it will not calculate plan area automatically for you, show interactive 3d view, change printout scale easily, automatically read measurements from bluetooth later distance meter and it will quietly accept all measurement errors...</div></div></div></div><div jscontroller="H6eOGe" jsmodel="y8Aajc" jsdata="yf3HXc;gp:AOqpTOGy07MAakK-b-3JLA1cc9f689frTpZ6qBeOdCpUX5RciRMzQplakwDelvgaKgotEJFGumvCw2biuE3WSg;$1832 YjFXEf;_;$256"><div class="zc7KVe"><div class="vDSMeb bAhLNe" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-r_pZ00fSy0c/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuucmqy-6NTxNGMehdw0v62rdXoGzxcQ/w48-h48-n/photo.jpg" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-r_pZ00fSy0c/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/AMZuucmqy-6NTxNGMehdw0v62rdXoGzxcQ/w96-h96-n/photo.jpg 2x" class="T75of ZqMJr" aria-hidden="true" data-iml="237208"></div><div class="d15Mdf bAhLNe"><div class="xKpxId zc7KVe"><div class="bAhLNe kx8XBd"><span class="X43Kjb">Lindsey Mason</span><div><span class="nt2C1d"><div class="pf5lIe"><div aria-label="Rated 4 stars out of five stars" role="img"><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="vQHuPe bUWb7c"></div><div class="L0jl5e bUWb7c"></div></div></div></span><span class="p2TkOb">September 11, 2019</span></div></div><div class="YCMBp GVFJbb"><div jsaction="JIbuQc:isb5Wc(isb5Wc);NrJVc:tUsItb;Juy6d:Hw9KTb;yIJnmd:kuHRr;s4H3C:HBdSge;" jsname="OuHhoc"><div class="XlMhZe"><div role="button" class="U26fgb mUbCce fKz7Od YYBxpf" jslog="77038